  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "\\(P\\) is a point interior to rectangle \\(ABCD\\) and such that \\(PA=3\\) inches, \\(PD=4\\) inches, and \\(PC=5\\) inches. Then \\(PB,\\) in inches, equals:",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
